{"id":12223693612171,"type":"artist","name":"Ben Lee","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":10,"info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Ben_Lee_australia_day_live.jpg?width=500","bio":"Ben Lee (nacido el 11 de septiembre de 1978) es un músico Australiano. Empezó como músico a los 14 años con el grupo de Sidney Noise Addict, pero encarriló su carrera en solitario cuando el grupo se separó, cerca de los 18. También es actor y ha intervenido en la película australiana de 2003 \"The rage in placid lake\". Salió muchos años con la actriz Claire Danes pero su relación terminó en 2003.\n\nLa carrera musical de Ben Lee empezó en","tags":["singer-songwriter","indie","australian","indie pop","alternative"]},"works":[{"id":128422149454877,"type":"album","name":"Breathing Tornados","artist":"Ben Lee","year":1998,"weight":6,"yt":"UhyY1dZQvb0","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":80026152013792,"type":"song","name":"Cigarettes Will Kill You","artist":"Ben Lee","year":1998,"weight":2,"yt":"F1WIBy6Imw8","src":"singles","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":47661976793658,"name":"Triple J Hottest 100 · 1998","rank":2,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":222478615844328,"type":"song","name":"Nothing Much Happens","artist":"Ben Lee","year":1999,"weight":2,"yt":"nC_tLnzN0tU","src":"singles","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":169477953497490,"name":"Triple J Hottest 100 · 1999","rank":81,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":86488523831309,"type":"song","name":"Something Borrowed, Something Blue","artist":"Ben Lee","year":2002,"weight":2,"yt":"bScFcWh5gYE","src":"singles","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":242934451798218,"name":"Triple J Hottest 100 · 2002","rank":22,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":209228919635189,"type":"song","name":"Gamble Everything for Love","artist":"Ben Lee","year":2004,"weight"